---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Base
  title="Cooper Tillotson | Marketing Operations & Product Marketing"
  description="CRM implementation, competitive intelligence, and SEO/analytics. Moving from Marketing Coordinator into Marketing Ops, RevOps, and Product Marketing."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section id="hero" class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
        Open to new roles
      </div>
      <h1>I build the systems<br />marketing teams run on.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        CRM implementation, competitive intelligence, SEO/analytics.
        Currently looking for Marketing Ops/RevOps or Product Marketing roles.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#work" class="btn btn-primary">See my work</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Selected Work -->
  <section id="work" class="section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Selected Work</span>
      <h2>Projects that show how I think</h2>
      <div class="work-grid">
        <a href="/gtm-spec" class="work-card work-card--featured">
          <div class="work-card-inner">
            <span class="work-tag work-tag--accent">Spec Project</span>
            <h3>AI-Assisted Design Handoff for Figma</h3>
            <p>
              A spec GTM strategy for an AI feature that closes the
              design-to-engineering gap. Covers problem framing, target segment,
              positioning, competitive landscape, launch plan, and success
              metrics.
            </p>
            <ul class="work-highlights">
              <li>Go-to-Market Strategy</li>
              <li>Product Marketing</li>
              <li>Competitive Analysis</li>
            </ul>
            <span class="work-card-cta">Read the case study &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <article class="work-card">
          <span class="work-tag">CRM / Process</span>
          <h3>CRM Implementation, Start to Scale</h3>
          <p>
            Led implementation of Simpson's Click CRM on Microsoft Power Apps,
            scope docs, UX copy, IT provisioning, and a full
            dealer/distributor data cleanup ahead of go-live. Built out KPI
            dashboards and defined the pull-through tracking model (House Pack
            / LSQ / Special Pricing tiers) that gives outside reps visibility
            into large-quote pipeline health across an 11-branch distributor
            network.
          </p>
          <ul class="work-highlights">
            <li>Power Apps</li>
            <li>Power BI</li>
            <li>Systems Implementation</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="work-card">
          <span class="work-tag">Competitive Intel</span>
          <h3>Competitive & AI-Search Intelligence</h3>
          <p>
            Built competitive intelligence practices that didn't exist at the
            company before, including AI search visibility analysis against a
            category competitor and backlink/positioning research to inform
            content strategy. Established the ongoing cadence for tracking
            where Simpson stands versus category players.
          </p>
          <ul class="work-highlights">
            <li>SEMrush</li>
            <li>Competitive Analysis</li>
            <li>AI Search (GEO/AIO)</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="work-card">
          <span class="work-tag">SEO / Analytics</span>
          <h3>Organic Search, Owned End-to-End</h3>
          <p>
            Took over in-house SEO for a legacy manufacturing site with no
            prior formal practice, driving consistent YoY organic growth,
            doubling branded CTR, and improving non-branded average position
            by ~37 spots. Built the company's first GEO/AIO strategy
            (ChatGPT, Perplexity, AI Overviews, Copilot) and deployed schema
            markup and llms.txt from scratch.
          </p>
          <ul class="work-highlights">
            <li>SEO</li>
            <li>GA4/GSC</li>
            <li>Schema Markup</li>
            <li>GEO/AIO</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Skills -->
  <section id="skills">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Skills & Tools</span>
      <h2>What I work with</h2>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div class="skill-group">
          <h3>CRM & Systems</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>HubSpot (implementation, workflows, reporting)</li>
            <li>Salesforce (basic admin, reporting)</li>
            <li>CRM data hygiene and migration</li>
            <li>Marketing automation setup</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-group">
          <h3>Competitive Intelligence</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Win/loss analysis</li>
            <li>Competitor positioning tracking</li>
            <li>Battle card creation</li>
            <li>Market landscape mapping</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-group">
          <h3>SEO & Analytics</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Google Analytics (GA4)</li>
            <li>Google Search Console</li>
            <li>Technical SEO audits</li>
            <li>Keyword research and content strategy</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-group">
          <h3>Building & Learning</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Process documentation and SOPs</li>
            <li>Workflow automation (Zapier, Make)</li>
            <li>HTML/CSS (this site)</li>
            <li>Learning SQL for reporting</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About -->
  <section id="about" class="section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">About</span>
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <div class="about-content">
        <p>
          [Short career arc paragraph. Where you started, the inflection point
          at Simpson where you moved from pure marketing into ops/systems work,
          and where you're headed. Keep it human, 3-4 sentences max.]
        </p>
        <p>
          [Optional second paragraph: what you're like to work with, or a brief
          personal note. One to two sentences.]
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section id="contact">
    <div class="container contact-container">
      <span class="section-label">Contact</span>
      <h2>Let's talk</h2>
      <p class="contact-intro">
        Open to Marketing Ops/RevOps and Product Marketing roles.
        Warm intros are great, cold emails work too.
      </p>
      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="mailto:tillycooper2017@gmail.com" class="btn btn-primary">
          Email me
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://linkedin.com/in/coopertillotson"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn btn-ghost"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: 6rem 0 5rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% -20%, var(--color-accent-subtle) 0%, transparent 60%),
      var(--color-bg);
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow-dot {
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    background: #22c55e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; }
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Buttons */
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #fff;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px var(--color-shadow-lg);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-color: var(--color-border);
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-color: var(--color-text-light);
    color: var(--color-text);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* Alternating section backgrounds */
  .section-alt {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }

  /* Work grid */
  .work-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .work-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .work-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px var(--color-shadow);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .work-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px var(--color-shadow);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .work-card--featured {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent-subtle) 0%, var(--color-surface) 60%);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-light);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .work-card--featured::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 4px;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg) 0 0 var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .work-card--featured:hover {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px var(--color-shadow-lg);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .work-card-inner {
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .work-card-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .work-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-tag-bg);
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .work-tag--accent {
    background: var(--color-accent-light);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .work-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .work-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .work-highlights {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .work-highlights li {
    background: var(--color-tag-bg);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
  }

  /* Skills */
  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .skill-group {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px var(--color-shadow);
  }

  .skill-group h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-accent-light);
  }

  .skill-group ul {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .skill-group li {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
  }

  .skill-group li + li {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }

  /* About */
  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-content p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  /* Contact */
  .contact-container {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .contact-intro {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
